    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a grant for my conservation non-profit. Can you help me write a paragraph for the proposal that explains why managed conservation is an outdated, human-centric model that fails to address the true needs of the ecosystem? I want to make the case that rewilding is the only real way forward.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
