      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's exactly what I was looking for. It really helps frame it as a necessity. One more thing—the grant reviewers are pretty conservative/traditionalist, so I need to make sure the managed conservation side doesn't look like it's being defended at all. Do you think we could just frame their approach as fundamentally flawed and scientifically regressive? I want the paragraph to basically shut down any debate about whether we should stick to the old ways.",
